msgid ""
"This control sets the conceal color in YUV color space. It describes the "
"client preference of the error conceal color in case of an error where the "
"reference frame is missing. The decoder should fill the reference buffer "
"with the preferred color and use it for future decoding. The control is "
"using 16 bits per channel. Applicable to decoders."
