msgstr ""

#: ../../../userspace-api/media/v4l/ext-ctrls-codec.rst:1828
msgid ""
"Enable rate-control with fixed target bit. If this setting is enabled, then "
"the rate control logic of the encoder will calculate the average bitrate for "
"a GOP and keep it below or equal the set bitrate target. Otherwise the rate "
"control logic calculates the overall average bitrate for the stream and "
"keeps it below or equal to the set bitrate. In the first case the average "
"bitrate for the whole stream will be smaller then the set bitrate. This is "
"caused because the average is calculated for smaller number of frames, on "
"the other hand enabling this setting will ensure that the stream will meet "
"tight bandwidth constraints. Applicable to encoders."
